---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '在中国付款失败时该怎么办';
const description = '在中国的外国游客常见的支付失败原因以及您的二维码支付获胜时的逐步故障排除\'t go through.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/payment/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Payment
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">💳 支付</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        What to Do When Your Payment Fails in China
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">不要惊慌——大多数付款失败都很容易解决。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>十几个短语会改变人们对待你的方式。</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-red-50 to-orange-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-4">⏱️ 阅读4分钟</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-red-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>付款失败对外国用户来说很常见。</strong> Most are caused by daily limits, bank fraud blocks, or network issues. Try switching to cash, using a different app, or connecting to WiFi. If nothing works, wait a few hours and try again.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        It's going to happen at some point. You're at a shop, you scan the QR code, the app spins for a moment, and then — error. Payment failed.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Don't panic. Payment failures in China are common for foreign users, and most of the time it's a simple fix.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🔍</span> Why It Happened
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">1.你已达到每日限额</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">支付宝和微信支付都对你可以花多少钱有限制。如果你一直在购物，你可能会碰到天花板。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>修复：</strong> Wait until the next day — daily limits reset.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">2.您的银行阻止了该交易</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">你的银行看到来自中国的指控，认为这是欺诈。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>Fix:</strong> Check your notifications — your bank usually sends an SMS asking if it's you. Approve it and try again. Notify your bank before you travel to avoid this.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">3.网络问题</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">您的VPN可能已断开连接，或者商家的互联网速度很慢。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>Fix:</strong> Check your VPN, toggle airplane mode on/off, or ask the merchant if they can try again.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">4.商户不接受国际卡</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">一些较小的供应商的支付账户只适用于中国银行卡。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>Fix:</strong> Use cash, or ask if they accept WeChat Pay (sometimes that works when Alipay doesn't).</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">✅</span> Quick Troubleshooting Checklist
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-8 not-prose">
        <ol class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            <div><strong>切换到其他应用程序</strong> — If Alipay fails, try WeChat Pay (or vice versa)</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
            <div><strong>使用现金</strong> — Always carry ¥500–1000 in small bills as backup</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
            <div><strong>连接到WiFi</strong> — Ask the merchant for their WiFi; sometimes cellular data is the issue</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
            <div><strong>重新启动应用程序</strong> — Close and reopen Alipay or WeChat</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">5</span>
            <div><strong>等待并重试</strong> — Some issues resolve themselves after a few minutes</div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关指南</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">如何在中国付款</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">完整的付款概览</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">如何设置支付宝</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">分步设置指南</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Sources</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://www.alipayplus.com/consumer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">支付宝-消费者中心</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://cs.help.wechat.com/hc/en-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">微信-帮助中心</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>